&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor a high-performing in-house team of M&amp;amp;A legal professionals, fostering a culture of growth and execution excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Lyft’s Corporate Development team and Treasury team as well as advise company leadership and cross-functional stakeholders (e.g. people, accounting, tax, treasury, operations, etc.) on novel corporate legal issues, opportunities and risks of corporate transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
