&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with people management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching consumer facing products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on a growth-focused team/org responsible for top line metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a diverse set of engineering roles, such as server and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and ability to communicate complex technical trade-offs effectively to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with a low-ego, highly collaborative, and cross-functional mindset while actively lifting up the team.&lt;/li&gt;
