&lt;li&gt;Support different theft and loss initiatives being driven across the bikes and scooters line of business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a true thought leader by understanding trends in organized theft, and proactively driving continuous improvement across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and maintenance of Lyft&#39;s policies and practices in close partnership with internal cross-functional partners, including Privacy/Identity/Integrity (PII), Risk, Community Safety, Legal, Public Policy, and other Operations teams and leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with threat and risk assessments, investigations, mitigation, and protection efforts for Executive Protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist other business lines at Lyft with community outreach activities and initiatives as needed&lt;/li&gt;
