&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated expertise in campaign finance law and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building and scaling corporate PAC programs and political giving operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of political strategy, project management, budget management, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing relationships with elected officials, political committees, and fundraising networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex political campaigns, facilitate cross-functional collaboration, and manage internal relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
