&lt;p&gt;Lyft is looking for a Paralegal II to join its Legal Team! Working closely with Lyft’s in-house counsel and paralegal team, you will be responsible for investigating and responding to claims; conducting factual investigations; attending hearings and fact finding conferences; supporting administrative tracking of case related matters; and helping to keep Lyft’s employment and litigation operations efficient and organized.&amp;nbsp; You should be a self-starter but able to take direction easily and with a good attitude. Come join the fun at Lyft!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works closely with Lyft&#39;s in-house counsel Litigation &amp;amp; Employment team to support administrative, pre-litigation and litigation matters, as well as external legal requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages, tracks, calendars, and files responses to claims.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently conducts factual investigations to respond to administrative claims, demand letters, and other litigation and arbitration matters, and assist with drafting responses for these matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare memoranda and summaries of factual research and make recommendations to supervising attorneys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with gathering documents and information to respond to discovery or information requests.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete court or agency filings and attend court appearances or agency hearings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks proactively about improving processes to help Lyft’s legal operations continue to scale effectively with incredible growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaises with other teams within the company and external parties to ensure efficient workflow and handling of requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides legal support to in-house attorneys, paralegals, and various internal business partners to ensure compliance with internal policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helps define procedures and practices within Legal to promote efficient workflows and handling of legal requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintains overall governance of existing processes and strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaises with internal and external counsel and contacts on a day-to-day basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads projects and tasks within a broader legal strategy in collaboration with other team members.&lt;/li&gt;
