&lt;p&gt;Lyft Media is extending the value of Lyft&#39;s first-party rider data beyond our owned-and-operated surfaces. Through our Audience Solutions business, agencies and brands activate Lyft audiences across the open web, CTV, social, and DSPs — powered by one of the most distinctive mobility datasets in the US. We&#39;re hiring an Account Executive to grow this business across agency and holding company accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
