&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic public engagement plans positioning Lyft as a “Force for Good” and reliable thought partner to city and state officials and third party groups in key markets; while identifying other markets where Lyft’s public engagement could advance Lyft’s legislative and political strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
