&lt;li&gt;Produce and drive scalable system design for large, complex features — from idea through execution and launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers on the team, providing technical guidance and supporting their growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write well-crafted, well-tested, readable, maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews to ensure code quality and share knowledge across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the team&#39;s on-call rotation; identify, triage, debug, and resolve issues across our applications and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the ability to explain the various trade offs made in decisions&lt;/li&gt;
