&lt;p&gt;Lyft Infrastructure builds the systems to ship stable, scalable, and efficient services. We&#39;re hiring a Senior Technical Program Manager to lead our AI transformation in developer productivity: rethinking how engineers at Lyft work with AI, from tooling and agentic workflows to the platforms that make them possible. This role blends program delivery with product sense: you&#39;ll own the roadmap for your area, set priorities, and act as the voice of the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Lyft&#39;s AI transformation in developer productivity: shape the strategy for how AI enhances engineering workflows, from adoption of tools like Cursor, Copilot, and Claude Code to building AI-native workflows and agentic tooling for engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the roadmap: sequence the work, make the prioritization calls, and define what success looks like for AI-driven engineering productivity at Lyft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering teams to build AI-native workflows that solve real developer pain, not just deploy tools for the sake of it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run programs end to end, from kickoff through delivery, coordinating across infrastructure, developer platforms, and engineering leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of the customer: partner with engineering teams across Lyft, surface their pain points, and feed that back into priorities and roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics and adoption goals, gather and document customer requirements, and make sure what ships actually solves the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and infrastructure leads to build plans, call out risks early, and keep stakeholders aligned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own program health: track milestones, surface blockers before they slip, and keep decision-makers in the loop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your technical background to ask sharp questions and build plans the team believes in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share in the team&#39;s release oncall rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Experience:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Technical Program Management or a TPM/PM hybrid role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in software, data, or systems engineering, enough to go deep with engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a roadmap: setting strategy, prioritizing across competing demands, and defining what success looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developer productivity, developer tooling, or engineering platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with AI coding tools (Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code) and how engineers actually use them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience building or shipping AI-native or agentic workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record leading cross-functional programs with real dependencies and tight timelines, autonomously and with only high-level direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning customer relationships across engineering teams, gathering requirements, and translating their needs into roadmaps and technical specs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to glean meaningful insights from usage and productivity data to influence product planning and communicate to others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable defining and tracking success metrics and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator across the stack, from engineer to VP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great medical, dental, and vision insurance options with additional programs available when enrolled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family building benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Child care and pet benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan with company match to help save for your future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to 12 observed holidays, salaried team members have discretionary paid time off, hourly team members have 15 days paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;18 weeks of paid parental leave. Biological, adoptive, and foster parents are all eligible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Lyft credits and complimentary Lyft Pink membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
