&lt;li&gt;Proactively solve issues and foster trust with our beloved customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a personalized, positive and effortless experience for the Lyft community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Product, Marketing, and other teams to ensure a cohesive voice of support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a community advocate for Lyft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work a wide range of hours and weekends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
