&lt;li&gt;Solve complex real-time data transfer and synchronization issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement pixel perfect designs with advanced interactions, which are a joy to use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
