&lt;li&gt;Very knowledgeable about architecture and design patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked on and shipped large scale Android applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great product sense; you care about usability and good design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has worked collaboratively with product managers, designers, and other engineering teams to build complex products&lt;/li&gt;
